:markdown
  ## One of more processes on your box #{@box.name} have been killed because you hit your box's memory limits

  Your box's current memory configuration is #{@box.memory}MB.

  To avoid your processes being killed, you should upgrade the memory configuration of your box by visiting your [box's settings page](https://www.nitrous.io/app#boxes/#{@box.id}/edit)

  If you need more N2O in order to upgrade your box, you can complete some of these simple steps:

  * [Connect your Github](#{_bonus_url}), Google, Twitter and Facebook accounts

  * [Follow us on Twitter](#{_bonus_url}) and tweet about us

  * Install our [Chrome app](https://chrome.google.com/webstore/detail/nitrousio/kcbmakmdbnehgbakmgibcpjpafenmohd)

  Visit your [bonus page](#{_bonus_url}) to earn more N2O.

= mixpanel_pixel_track 'Box Memory Limit Hit Alert Received', @owner.email
